#: ../../tools/wormbase_tools.rst:32 d1146cacbd274776af47e96309655b89
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get expression data for a C. elegans gene from WormBase."
" Returns tissues where the gene is expressed, developmental stages, "
"subcellular localization, and expression clusters. Expression data is "
"curated from GFP reporters, antibody staining, RNA in situ, and "
"microarray experiments. Example: WBGene00006763 (unc-26) is expressed in "
"38 tissues including neurons, pharynx, and body wall muscle."
msgstr ""

